r;}.wsp-hero-left h1{font-size:2.1rem;}}.wsp-wrap h3{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #3182CE;border-radius:8px;padding:.9rem 1.25rem;margin:1.75rem 0 0;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1A202C;}.wsp-wrap h3+p{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin:0 0 .25rem;color:#444;}.wsp-wrap table td{vertical-align:top;}.chb-cta p{margin:0}.wsp-related{margin:2.5rem 0 1rem}.wsp-related h2{font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:600;}.wsp-related-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Nebraska Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: Rules for Selling a Rental</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Nebraska</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Nebraska Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Nebraska Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights sale</li><li>Turn the Nebraska Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Nebraska House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Nebraska statutes set the basic rules between landlords and tenants, including deposits, notices and what happens when a rental is sold.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Security deposit may not exceed one month&#x27;s periodic rent, plus a pet deposit of up to one-fourth of one month&#x27;s rent. (Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1416(1); <a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1416' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>The balance of the deposit and a written itemization must be delivered or mailed within fourteen days after termination of the tenancy. (Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1416; <a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1416' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Month-to-month tenancy may be terminated by either party with written notice at least thirty days before the periodic rental date; week-to-week requires seven days. (Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1437; <a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1437' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord may enter without consent in an emergency; otherwise must give at least twenty-four hours&#x27; written notice and enter only at reasonable times. (Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1423; <a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1423' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord must comply with minimum housing codes affecting health and safety, make repairs after written or actual notice to keep the premises fit and habitable, and maintain plumbing, heating and electrical facilities. (Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1419(1); <a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1419' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Nebraska?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Nebraska houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/nebraska-squatters-rights-adverse-possession/'>Nebraska Squatters Rights and Adverse Possession</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/nebraska-eviction-notice/'>Nebraska Eviction Notice: Types and Days</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/nebraska-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Nebraska guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-nebraska/'>We buy houses in Nebraska</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1416' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1416(1)</a></li><li><a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1437' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1437</a></li><li><a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1423' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1423</a></li><li><a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1419' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1419(1)</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Nebraska Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Nebraska\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-nebraska/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Nebraska Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/nebraska-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Nebraska Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights", "rank_math_description": "Nebraska landlord tenant law and tenant rights: deposits, notices, entry and selling a rented house. Official sources only.", "rank_math_focus