x(220px,1fr));gap:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Nebraska Eviction Notice Rules: Notice Types, Days and Selling the House</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Nebraska</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Nebraska Eviction Notice Rules: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Nebraska Eviction Notice Rules sale</li><li>Turn the Nebraska Eviction Notice Rules offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Nebraska House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Nebraska law requires a landlord to give a specific written notice before filing an eviction, and the number of days depends on the reason.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Nonpayment: landlord may terminate if rent is unpaid and the tenant fails to pay within seven calendar days after written notice of nonpayment and intent to terminate. (Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1431(2); <a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1431' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Lease violation: written notice that the agreement will terminate not less than thirty days after receipt if the breach is not remedied in fourteen days; if substantially the same breach recurs within six months, fourteen days&#x27; written notice. (Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1431(1); <a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1431' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Violent criminal activity, illegal sale of controlled substances, or activity threatening others&#x27; health or safety allows suit for possession after five days&#x27; written notice with no right to cure. (Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1431(4); <a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1431' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>No-cause end of month-to-month tenancy requires written notice at least thirty days before the periodic rental date. (Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1437(2); <a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1437' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Nebraska?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Nebraska houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/nebraska-squatters-rights-adverse-possession/'>Nebraska Squatters Rights and Adverse Possession</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/nebraska-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/'>Nebraska Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/nebraska-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Nebraska guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-nebraska/'>We buy houses in Nebraska</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1431' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1431(2)</a></li><li><a href='https://nebraskalegislature.gov/laws/statutes.php?statute=76-1437' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Neb. Rev. Stat. 76-1437(2)</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Nebraska Eviction Notice Rules, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Nebraska\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-nebraska/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Nebraska Eviction Notice: Types and Days\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/nebraska-eviction-notice/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Nebraska Eviction Notice: Types and Days", "rank_math_description": "Nebraska eviction notice rules: notice types, required days, which court hears the case and selling a rental. Official sources.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "nebraska eviction notice"}]